// Quality runs 0-100 across the whole game: product ceilings, achieved lot quality, equipment
// precision, and supplier material grade all share this scale so they can be compared directly.
// Declared here, above every consumer, because a const used before its declaration is a temporal
// dead zone error at module load — the exact bug class tdz_check.mjs exists to catch.
